  "instructions": [
    "In a large pot, heat 2 tablespoons of oil over medium heat",
    "Add the chopped onions and saute until they are translucent",
    "Add the sliced carrots and celery and cook until they start to soften",
    "Add the sliced gobo burdock and cook for an additional 5 minutes",
    "Add the canned fish, vegetable broth, sauerkraut, and dried thyme",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes",
    "Season the stew with salt and pepper to taste",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired"
  ],
